# the jar from its repository on 2026-11-17 and equals what Gradle resolved; for Maven Central artefacts that publish a .sha256 or
# .sha1 the value matches it. The three Beta15 and the two netty and the math lines are timestamped snapshot builds from
# repo.opencollab.dev/maven-snapshots (no release of CloudburstMC Protocol exists); the rest are releases. A change to any
# version in gradle/libs.versions.toml fails checkCloudburstPins until these lines are re-derived from a real download.
